{"id":"besbarmaq-dagi","qid":"Q2503596","category":"mountain","type":"oronym","names":{"az":"Beşbarmaq dağı","ru":"Бешбармаг","en":"Besh Barmag Mountain"},"coordinates":[49.23222,40.95833],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"quba-xacmaz","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q820940","az":"Siyəzən rayonu","en":"Siyazan District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[{"lang":"ru","heading":"Этимология","text":"Слово «бешбармаг» с азербайджанского и других тюркских языков переводится как «пять пальцев», так как очертания горы напоминают пять пальцев руки.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru","anchor":"Этимология"}],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Beşbarmaq dağı və ya Baş Bərmək dağı, həmçinin Xızırzində — erkən orta əsrlərdə Qafqaz Albaniyası dövrü Xors-Xurs qayası adlanan və Xorsvem kimi göstərilən Beşbarmaq tarixi Şeşpara ərazisinin başlanğıcı sayılır. Karbonat tərkibli breksiyalaşmış əhəngdaşlarından (dolomitlərdən) ibarət qaya parçası \"səhra aysberqi\"ni xatırladır və Bakı-Siyəzən avtomobil yolunun 95 km-də ucalır. Beşbarmaq dağı dəniz səviyyəsindən 445 m yüksəklikdədir.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Бешбармаг (азерб. Beşbarmaq) — гора в Азербайджане, расположенная к юго-востоку от города Сиазань, в 80 км от Баку, неподалёку от побережья Каспийского моря. В народе известна также как гора Хыдыр Зинда и является местом паломничества.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Besh Barmag (Azerbaijani: Beşbarmaq) literally translated as Five Fingers, is in Siazan District of Azerbaijan, not far from the Caspian Sea, in the territory of Qalaşıxı village.\nIt rises to 382 m (1,253 ft) above the sea level overlooking the Baku-Quba Highway. The mountain is a solid rock and is one of the most famous mountains in the Caucasus, known for its mythical stories. It is a sacred place for regular visitation by pilgrims.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Be%C5%9Fbarmaq_da%C4%9F%C4%B1_2024-c%C3%BC_ild%C9%99.jpg/960px-Be%C5%9Fbarmaq_da%C4%9F%C4%B1_2024-c%C3%BC_ild%C9%99.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Be%C5%9Fbarmaq_da%C4%9F%C4%B1_2024-c%C3%BC_ild%C9%99.jpg/960px-Be%C5%9Fbarmaq_da%C4%9F%C4%B1_2024-c%C3%BC_ild%C9%99.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":800,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Be%C5%9Fbarmaq_da%C4%9F%C4%B1_2024-c%C3%BC_ild%C9%99.jpg","title":"Beşbarmaq dağı 2024-cü ildə.jpg","artist":"Sefer azeri","credit":"Own work","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q2503596: Besh Barmag Mountain","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2503596","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Beşbarmaq dağı","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Be%C5%9Fbarmaq_da%C4%9F%C4%B1&oldid=9000072","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Be%C5%9Fbarmaq_da%C4%9F%C4%B1","revid":9000072,"revDate":"2026-07-15","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Бешбармаг","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%91%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%B3&oldid=151191964","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%B3","revid":151191964,"revDate":"2026-01-16","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Besh Barmag Mountain","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Besh_Barmag_Mountain&oldid=1368613471","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Besh_Barmag_Mountain","revid":1368613471,"revDate":"2026-08-10","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Beşbarmaq dağı 2024-cü ildə.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Be%C5%9Fbarmaq_da%C4%9F%C4%B1_2024-c%C3%BC_ild%C9%99.jpg","licence":"CC0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"sourced"}